        syntax: 'from -> to : "What it does" tech="<protocol>"',
        meaning: "Adds a relationship between two elements. The label and tech= are both optional; the technology is a tag at the end of the label. -> is a call, --> an asynchronous or optional one (dashed), ..> an event (dotted), and <-> or <--> go both ways. In a view=dynamic diagram the lines are numbered in the order written.",
        example: 'spa -> api : "Makes API calls to" tech="JSON/HTTPS"'
